因为环境肯定是越来越差。学佛者都</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%89%93%e5%9d%90%e7%aa%8d%e8%af%802.assets/640-1671628409288-210.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>静坐</category><category>站桩</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>关于打坐 | 不得不说的几个窍诀(一)</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%89%93%E5%9D%90%E7%AA%8D%E8%AF%801/</link><pubDate>Thu, 24 Nov 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Thu, 24 Nov 2022 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%89%93%E5%9D%90%E7%AA%8D%E8%AF%801/</guid><description>气脉是否通畅 中国五千年文化有很多非常了不起的传承，比如说道家、佛家的等等。我们发现，从古至今得到一些成就的人基本上是通过打坐获得的。比如王阳</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%89%93%e5%9d%90%e7%aa%8d%e8%af%801.assets/640-1671630296005-237.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>静坐</category><category>站桩</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>[置顶]站桩与静坐详细教程</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/meditation-detailed-guide/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sun, 21 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/meditation-detailed-guide/</guid><description>姿势与要领 那么站桩和静坐，首先来讲它们的原理其实是一样的，只不过我们把它区分了。 从相上来讲，一个是站着，一个是坐着。现在来讲的话，我们很多人</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/meditation-detailed-guide.assets/9109a2_7a6f160881b244028452d0f0a2b2c727mv2.webp" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>静坐</category><category>站桩</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>最美相遇：2）念恩报恩</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%9C%80%E7%BE%8E%E7%9B%B8%E9%81%87-%E5%BF%B5%E6%81%A9%E6%8A%A5%E6%81%A9/</link><pubDate>Fri, 18 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Fri, 18 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%9C%80%E7%BE%8E%E7%9B%B8%E9%81%87-%E5%BF%B5%E6%81%A9%E6%8A%A5%E6%81%A9/</guid><description>接上期： ✨最美相遇：1）健康是福 4、妻舅·不可思议 出殡那天早上阴雨天气，去殡仪馆的路上一直细雨蒙蒙。 火化时出来一看，天上突然现出了太阳，不断</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%9c%80%e7%be%8e%e7%9b%b8%e9%81%87%20%e5%bf%b5%e6%81%a9%e6%8a%a5%e6%81%a9.assets/640-1753277959904-70.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>茶话会：关于放下</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E8%8C%B6%E8%AF%9D%E4%BC%9A-%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E6%94%BE%E4%B8%8B/</link><pubDate>Thu, 17 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Thu, 17 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E8%8C%B6%E8%AF%9D%E4%BC%9A-%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E6%94%BE%E4%B8%8B/</guid><description>壹 安住 放下，这两个字听起来简单，其实蕴藏着对生活的深层理解。 放下不是放弃，也不是逃避。不是硬生生的丢掉什么，而是一种更清醒、更从容的生活态度</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%8c%b6%e8%af%9d%e4%bc%9a%20%e5%85%b3%e4%ba%8e%e6%94%be%e4%b8%8b.assets/640-1753276968281-1.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>最美相遇：1）健康是福</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%9C%80%E7%BE%8E%E7%9B%B8%E9%81%87-%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7%E6%98%AF%E7%A6%8F/</link><pubDate>Sun, 29 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sun, 29 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%9C%80%E7%BE%8E%E7%9B%B8%E9%81%87-%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7%E6%98%AF%E7%A6%8F/</guid><description>一、思索·一头雾水 一晃五旬已过，人生已过大半。无常随时到来，真是人生短暂。回想幼时，仿佛还在眼前。 自小受到家庭、学校教育，相信科学，不迷信。</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%9c%80%e7%be%8e%e7%9b%b8%e9%81%87%20%e5%81%a5%e5%ba%b7%e6%98%af%e7%a6%8f.assets/640-1751296578046-46.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>手机</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA/</link><pubDate>Wed, 04 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 04 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA/</guid><description>专心做一件事 老师的文章，需要多次拜读、体会、串习，每一阶段读的时候总会有不同的感触。 不知道为什么就到这样的状态，同年龄段的朋友，为了工作、事</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%89%8b%e6%9c%ba.assets/640-1749299288874-4.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>朝圣之旅</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%9C%9D%E5%9C%A3%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%85/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Fri, 30 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%9C%9D%E5%9C%A3%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%85/</guid><description>朝圣 一切都是 最好的安排 心心念念了好几年的朝圣，今年终于实现了，一切都是最好的安排。带上先生和女儿，踏上了多伦多这趟向往已久的旅程。 见识过新冠</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%9c%9d%e5%9c%a3%e4%b9%8b%e6%97%85.assets/640.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>我的抗癌康复之路：站桩打坐篇</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%97%E7%99%8C%E5%BA%B7%E5%A4%8D%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF-%E7%AB%99%E6%A1%A9%E6%89%93%E5%9D%90%E7%AF%87/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Mon, 26 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%97%E7%99%8C%E5%BA%B7%E5%A4%8D%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF-%E7%AB%99%E6%A1%A9%E6%89%93%E5%9D%90%E7%AF%87/</guid><description>时八个月的站桩打坐，让我受益匪浅 —— 助我重返工作岗位，为我保驾护航。 我在医院的班次是十二小时的，随着体力慢慢提升，逐步增加工作时间，适应劳动</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%88%91%e7%9a%84%e6%8a%97%e7%99%8c%e5%ba%b7%e5%a4%8d%e4%b9%8b%e8%b7%af%20%e7%ab%99%e6%a1%a9%e6%89%93%e5%9d%90%e7%af%87.assets/640-1749300786263-33.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>站桩</category><category>静坐</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>放下</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%94%BE%E4%B8%8B/</link><pubDate>Tue, 20 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Tue, 20 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%94%BE%E4%B8%8B/</guid><description>老师开示完之后，最近几天反复地串习、思考，真正达到心静。 我觉得首先是放下。 这个放下，不是失败后的逃避，也不是消极的避世，不是自己口口声声的我</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%94%be%e4%b8%8b.assets/image-20250607090437195.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>千金难换</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E5%8D%83%E9%87%91%E9%9A%BE%E6%8D%A2/</link><pubDate>Wed, 07 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 07 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E5%8D%83%E9%87%91%E9%9A%BE%E6%8D%A2/</guid><description>在老师这里学修也有一年了，老师做了很多重要的开示，也指出了我们很多修行上存在的病。 末学是招招中招，实在是病得不轻，非常感恩老师的慈悲开示。老</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%8d%83%e9%87%91%e9%9a%be%e6%8d%a2.assets/image-20250513112009673.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>辟谷随笔</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E8%BE%9F%E8%B0%B7%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%94/</link><pubDate>Wed, 02 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 02 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E8%BE%9F%E8%B0%B7%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%94/</guid><description>五天辟谷 •复谷 辟谷第一天 喝了红糖白开水 白天站桩开气门 晚上走走散散步 整天精神尚可以 晚上多梦心不宁 肠胃空空思不空 持咒念F 要放下 辟谷第二天 今天感觉</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%be%9f%e8%b0%b7%e9%9a%8f%e7%ac%94.assets/640.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>辟谷</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>七星连珠共修小结（文字版）</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E4%B8%83%E6%98%9F%E8%BF%9E%E7%8F%A0%E5%85%B1%E4%BF%AE%E5%B0%8F%E7%BB%93-%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%E7%89%88/</link><pubDate>Sat, 22 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sat, 22 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E4%B8%83%E6%98%9F%E8%BF%9E%E7%8F%A0%E5%85%B1%E4%BF%AE%E5%B0%8F%E7%BB%93-%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%E7%89%88/</guid><description>参加七星连珠共修200多位，昨天又有一人跑过来跟我讲。 仍需借船渡到彼岸 在这个娑婆世界，我们身体因为受空气、水、还有很多饮食的这些限制。从不同</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e4%b8%83%e6%98%9f%e8%bf%9e%e7%8f%a0%e5%85%b1%e4%bf%ae%e5%b0%8f%e7%bb%93%20%e6%96%87%e5%ad%97%e7%89%88.assets/640.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>站桩</category><category>静坐</category><category>站桩打坐</category><category>七星连珠共修</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>春季辟谷，正当时... （文字版）</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%98%A5%E5%AD%A3%E8%BE%9F%E8%B0%B7%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E6%97%B6-%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%E7%89%88/</link><pubDate>Fri, 21 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Fri, 21 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%98%A5%E5%AD%A3%E8%BE%9F%E8%B0%B7%E6%AD%A3%E5%BD%93%E6%97%B6-%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%E7%89%88/</guid><description>今天开始，如果说有人想要跟我们这边一起辟谷的话呢，可以辟下谷。 我们这次根据每个人的情况，有三天的、有五天的、还有七天的一个辟谷。👉辟谷它有很</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%98%a5%e5%ad%a3%e8%be%9f%e8%b0%b7%e6%ad%a3%e5%bd%93%e6%97%b6%20%e6%96%87%e5%ad%97%e7%89%88.assets/640.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>辟谷</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>七星连珠共修：意犹未尽</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E4%B8%83%E6%98%9F%E8%BF%9E%E7%8F%A0%E5%85%B1%E4%BF%AE-%E6%84%8F%E7%8A%B9%E6%9C%AA%E5%B0%BD/</link><pubDate>Wed, 12 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 12 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh