Tutorials</category></item><item><title>辟谷夏令营</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E8%BE%9F%E8%B0%B7%E5%A4%8F%E4%BB%A4%E8%90%A5/</link><pubDate>Thu, 09 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Thu, 09 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E8%BE%9F%E8%B0%B7%E5%A4%8F%E4%BB%A4%E8%90%A5/</guid><description>疾病丛生的年代：很多时候，虽然诊断出了问题在哪儿，但是却不知道怎么治、找谁治。更多时候，可能是无力负担。 中国传统医学有着几千年历史，它来自道</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%be%9f%e8%b0%b7%e5%a4%8f%e4%bb%a4%e8%90%a5.assets/640.webp" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>辟谷</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>分享 | 小医生带领群友们站桩</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E5%88%86%E4%BA%AB-%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E5%B8%A6%E9%A2%86%E7%BE%A4%E5%8F%8B%E4%BB%AC%E7%AB%99%E6%A1%A9/</link><pubDate>Mon, 09 Oct 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Mon, 09 Oct 2023 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E5%88%86%E4%BA%AB-%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%BB%E7%94%9F%E5%B8%A6%E9%A2%86%E7%BE%A4%E5%8F%8B%E4%BB%AC%E7%AB%99%E6%A1%A9/</guid><description>天得一清，地得一宁，人得一灵。 能够自觉觉察自我，关照内外，坦然、安然和欣然面对当下的种种身体反应，不怀疑、不提问、不害怕、不追求、不执着。认</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%88%86%e4%ba%ab%20%e5%b0%8f%e5%8c%bb%e7%94%9f%e5%b8%a6%e9%a2%86%e7%be%a4%e5%8f%8b%e4%bb%ac%e7%ab%99%e6%a1%a9.assets/image-20231010170446195.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>站桩</category><category>静坐</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>二次辟谷 | 死而复生</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/fasting-second-time/</link><pubDate>Mon, 11 Oct